:math:`\lbrace (i, i) \rbrace` for :math:`i \in [0, \min\{d_{1}, d_{2}\} - 1]` where
:math:`d_{1}, d_{2}` are the dimensions of the matrix.

Args:
    input (Tensor): the input tensor.
    diagonal (int, optional): the diagonal to consider

Keyword args:
